WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.725 --> 00:00:01.925
HERE'S HOPING.

00:00:01.926 --> 00:00:02.659
ROBERT, THANK YOU VERY MUCH.

00:00:02.660 --> 00:00:04.027
&gt;&gt; THANK YOU FOR HAVING ME.

00:00:04.028 --> 00:00:04.861
&gt;&gt; Tucker: JASON NICHOLS IS

00:00:04.862 --> 00:00:06.930
RIGHT IN THE MIDDLE OF THIS

00:00:06.931 --> 00:00:09.366
DEBATE, AN ACTUAL PROFESSOR,

00:00:09.367 --> 00:00:10.100
TEACHES AFRICAN-AMERICAN STUDIES

00:00:10.101 --> 00:00:11.735
AT THE UNIVERSITY OF MARYLAND

00:00:11.736 --> 00:00:12.869
PEER THANK YOU FOR COMING ON.

00:00:12.870 --> 00:00:14.271
&gt;&gt; THANK YOU FOR HAVING ME.

00:00:14.272 --> 00:00:16.139
&gt;&gt; Tucker: IT SEEMS LIKE A

00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:18.975
BASELINE FOR UNIVERSITY TO HAVE

00:00:18.976 --> 00:00:21.711
PRETTY MUCH ABSOLUTE FREEDOM OF

00:00:21.712 --> 00:00:22.512
SPEECH, A PREREQUISITE FOR

00:00:22.513 --> 00:00:23.046
FREEDOM OF THOUGHT.

00:00:23.047 --> 00:00:24.548
WHAT IS THE POINT OF HAVING

00:00:24.549 --> 00:00:25.715
COLLEGES IF YOU CAN'T SAY

00:00:25.716 --> 00:00:26.450
WHATEVER YOU THINK?

00:00:26.451 --> 00:00:28.318
&gt;&gt; I THINK NUMBER ONE, AND

00:00:28.319 --> 00:00:30.921
SOCIETY, WE DON'T HAVE COMPLETE

00:00:30.922 --> 00:00:31.555
FREEDOM OF SPEECH.

00:00:31.556 --> 00:00:32.322
&gt;&gt; Tucker: TRUE.

00:00:32.323 --> 00:00:35.058
&gt;&gt; THERE IS LIBEL, THERE IS

00:00:35.059 --> 00:00:39.529
DEFAMATION, THERE ARE THREATS OF

00:00:39.530 --> 00:00:40.897
VIOLENCE, AND INCITING VIOLENCE.

00:00:40.898 --> 00:00:42.332
THOSE ARE LIMITS ON FREE SPEECH.

00:00:42.333 --> 00:00:44.100
I THINK WE HAVE THIS IDEA THAT

00:00:44.101 --> 00:00:46.703
FREEDOM OF SPEECH MEANS YOU CAN

00:00:46.704 --> 00:00:47.704
SAY ANYTHING AT ANY TIME.

00:00:47.705 --> 00:00:49.506
&gt;&gt; Tucker: NO, WE KNOW WHAT IT

00:00:49.507 --> 00:00:50.707
IS, BECAUSE OF BRANDON VERSUS

00:00:50.708 --> 00:00:52.742
OHIO IN 1967, THE FAMOUS

00:00:52.743 --> 00:00:54.511
SUPREME COURT CASE, VERY

00:00:54.512 --> 00:00:55.145
SPECIFICALLY OUTLINED THE

00:00:55.146 --> 00:00:56.713
BOUNDARIES OF FREE SPEECH.

00:00:56.714 --> 00:00:59.316
LIBEL IS NOT ALLOWED, OF COURSE,

00:00:59.317 --> 00:01:00.550
IMMINENT THREATS OF VIOLENCE ARE

00:01:00.551 --> 00:01:00.984
NOT ALLOWED.

00:01:00.985 --> 00:01:06.122
EVERYTHING ELSE IS ALLOWED.

00:01:06.123 --> 00:01:07.691
APPLE, AMAZON, OF SOME BIG

00:01:07.692 --> 00:01:10.894
COMPANY -- COLLEGES EXIST TO BE

00:01:10.895 --> 00:01:11.761
AN OASIS IN THE MIDDLE OF

00:01:11.762 --> 00:01:13.530
COMMERCIAL SOCIETY FOR FREE

00:01:13.531 --> 00:01:13.897
THINKING.

00:01:13.898 --> 00:01:16.233
SO WHY WOULD THEY BE THE PLACES

00:01:16.234 --> 00:01:16.967
WHERE FREETHINKING IS PUNISHED

00:01:16.968 --> 00:01:18.502
MOST AGGRESSIVELY?

00:01:18.503 --> 00:01:21.238
&gt;&gt; I AGREE THAT THERE ARE MANY

00:01:21.239 --> 00:01:23.273
CASES -- YOU AND I ACTUALLY

00:01:23.274 --> 00:01:25.509
DISCUSSED A CASE A LITTLE WHILE

00:01:25.510 --> 00:01:26.910
AGO WHERE THERE WAS A COLLEGE

00:01:26.911 --> 00:01:27.644
PROFESSOR WHO SAID SOMETHING HE

00:01:27.645 --> 00:01:29.946
SHOULDN'T HAVE SAID, AND ALL OF

00:01:29.947 --> 00:01:30.647
A SUDDEN, PEOPLE ARE TALKING

00:01:30.648 --> 00:01:32.816
ABOUT HE NEEDS TO BE FIRED, THIS

00:01:32.817 --> 00:01:35.185
IS WHY WE ACTUALLY HAVE TENURE,

00:01:35.186 --> 00:01:37.454
TO PROTECT PEOPLE SO THEY CAN

00:01:37.455 --> 00:01:39.422
SAY WHAT IT IS THEY WANT.

00:01:39.423 --> 00:01:41.124
THERE HAVE BEEN ALL OF THESE

00:01:41.125 --> 00:01:41.925
ATTACKS, PEOPLE TRYING TO PUT

00:01:41.926 --> 00:01:44.461
LIMITS ON WHAT IT IS YOU SAY,

00:01:44.462 --> 00:01:48.298
AND I THINK THAT IS PROBLEMATIC.

00:01:48.299 --> 00:01:49.833
BUT, OVERALL, COLLEGES DO

00:01:49.834 --> 00:01:51.735
PROTECT FREEDOM OF SPEECH.

00:01:51.736 --> 00:01:52.569
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WHAT WOULD HAPPEN

00:01:52.570 --> 00:01:55.138
IF YOU WENT INTO YOUR CLASS -- I

00:01:55.139 --> 00:01:56.907
LIKE THAT DONALD TRUMP, AND WHAT

00:01:56.908 --> 00:01:57.941
I LIKE ABOUT HIM?

00:01:57.942 --> 00:01:59.109
I LIKE FAMILY SEPARATION, I LIKE

00:01:59.110 --> 00:02:00.210
THE WALL, HE IS RIGHT THAT

00:02:00.211 --> 00:02:03.513
MEXICO DOESN'T SEND US HIS BEST.

00:02:03.514 --> 00:02:05.115
IF YOU READ PORTIONS OF A TRUMP

00:02:05.116 --> 00:02:05.515
SPEECH.

00:02:05.516 --> 00:02:07.284
HOW WOULD THAT WORK OUT?

00:02:07.285 --> 00:02:08.552
&gt;&gt; I THINK STUDENTS WOULD

00:02:08.553 --> 00:02:09.819
DISAGREE, AND THEY HAVE EVERY

00:02:09.820 --> 00:02:10.520
RIGHT TO DISAGREE.

00:02:10.521 --> 00:02:11.221
&gt;&gt; Tucker: OF COURSE THEY

00:02:11.222 --> 00:02:12.956
WOULD COME I WOULD NEVER CONTEST

00:02:12.957 --> 00:02:13.356
THEIR RIGHT.

00:02:13.357 --> 00:02:15.725
&gt;&gt; EVEN IF THEY PROTESTED ME,

00:02:15.726 --> 00:02:17.127
THAT IS PART OF THEIR

00:02:17.128 --> 00:02:17.694
FIRST AMENDMENT RIGHT.

00:02:17.695 --> 00:02:18.562
&gt;&gt; Tucker: YOU ARE GETTING NO

00:02:18.563 --> 00:02:20.630
DEBATE FOR ME ON THAT.

00:02:20.631 --> 00:02:22.933
I BELIEVE IN THE FREE EXCHANGE

00:02:22.934 --> 00:02:23.733
OF IDEAS, AND DESPITE EFFORTS TO

00:02:23.734 --> 00:02:26.836
SHUT US DOWN AND SHUT US UP,

00:02:26.837 --> 00:02:28.038
WE'RE STILL DOING IT.

00:02:28.039 --> 00:02:30.040
BUT IF YOU SAID THAT IN A

00:02:30.041 --> 00:02:31.241
FACULTY MEETING, NO ONE WOULD

00:02:31.242 --> 00:02:31.641
ENGAGE YOU.

00:02:31.642 --> 00:02:33.009
PEOPLE WOULD JUST SAY, YOU KNOW

00:02:33.010 --> 00:02:34.945
WHAT, I KNOW YOU ARE

00:02:34.946 --> 00:02:36.580
AFRICAN-AMERICAN, BUT OBVIOUSLY

00:02:36.581 --> 00:02:37.213
SOME KIND OF FREAKY BIGOT.

00:02:37.214 --> 00:02:38.748
THEY WOULD TREAT YOU LIKE THEY

00:02:38.749 --> 00:02:39.749
TREATED KANYE WEST.

00:02:39.750 --> 00:02:40.483
NO ONE WOULD ENGAGE YOU AND SAY

00:02:40.484 --> 00:02:42.719
TALK THROUGH THOSE IDEAS.

00:02:42.720 --> 00:02:43.353
YOU REALLY THINK FAMILY

00:02:43.354 --> 00:02:45.155
SEPARATION IS A GOOD IDEA?

00:02:45.156 --> 00:02:46.723
NOW, THEY WOULD SHOUT AT YOU.

00:02:46.724 --> 00:02:48.124
&gt;&gt; I THINK PEOPLE WOULD

00:02:48.125 --> 00:02:49.326
DISAGREE, AND THEY WOULD HAVE

00:02:49.327 --> 00:02:50.160
EVERY RIGHT TO DISAGREE.

00:02:50.161 --> 00:02:50.860
&gt;&gt; Tucker: OF COURSE, THE

00:02:50.861 --> 00:02:52.929
WHOLE IDEA COLLEGE AS YOU SAY

00:02:52.930 --> 00:02:54.030
ONE THING, I SAY ANOTHER, THEN

00:02:54.031 --> 00:02:56.533
WE TALK ABOUT THEM.

00:02:56.534 --> 00:02:59.202
ISN'T THAT THE GOAL?

00:02:59.203 --> 00:03:00.637
&gt;&gt; THE CONVERSATION DOESN'T

00:03:00.638 --> 00:03:01.938
ALWAYS HAVE TO BE COMFORTABLE.

00:03:01.939 --> 00:03:02.706
&gt;&gt; Tucker: OF COURSE NOT.

00:03:02.707 --> 00:03:04.441
&gt;&gt; WE CAN YELL AT EACH OTHER, WE

00:03:04.442 --> 00:03:06.242
CAN SIT THERE AND TRY TO SHUT

00:03:06.243 --> 00:03:08.044
ONE ANOTHER DOWN, THAT IS PART

00:03:08.045 --> 00:03:08.511
OF FREE SPEECH.

00:03:08.512 --> 00:03:10.080
&gt;&gt; Tucker: OF COURSE, I GUESS

00:03:10.081 --> 00:03:10.947
THE MACRO QUESTION IS HAVE YOU

00:03:10.948 --> 00:03:14.517
EVER MET A GROUP OF PEOPLE WITH

00:03:14.518 --> 00:03:16.219
SMALLER MIND THAN THOSE WHO

00:03:16.220 --> 00:03:17.520
TEACH AND AMERICA'S COLLEGES?

00:03:17.521 --> 00:03:19.556
LESS OPEN TO NEW IDEAS, TO

00:03:19.557 --> 00:03:24.094
CHALLENGING, TRULY CHALLENGING

00:03:24.095 --> 00:03:24.461
CONCEPTS?

00:03:24.462 --> 00:03:25.328
&gt;&gt; THAT IS LITERALLY WHAT WE DO

00:03:25.329 --> 00:03:27.731
ON COLLEGE CAMPUSES, CHALLENGE

00:03:27.732 --> 00:03:29.966
CONCEPTS AND POPULAR IDEAS.

00:03:29.967 --> 00:03:31.701
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WHEN YOU GO TO YOUR

00:03:31.702 --> 00:03:33.370
NEXT FACULTY MEETING, JUST SAY,

00:03:33.371 --> 00:03:36.306
FOR THE RECORD, ABORTION IS

00:03:36.307 --> 00:03:36.706
MURDER.

00:03:36.707 --> 00:03:37.107
AT [LAUGHS]

00:03:37.108 --> 00:03:39.509
I WANT TO SEE HOW THAT WORKS.

00:03:39.510 --> 00:03:41.511
&gt;&gt; EVERY SEMESTER, WE HAVE

00:03:41.512 --> 00:03:42.245
ABORTION ACTIVISTS WHO COME OUT

00:03:42.246 --> 00:03:44.781
AND LITTER THE CAMPUS WITH

00:03:44.782 --> 00:03:48.718
PICTURES OF ABORTED FETUSES,

00:03:48.719 --> 00:03:49.619
PREGNANT WOMEN WALKING ACROSS

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:50.353
CAMPUS CRYING AND ALL OF THESE

00:03:50.354 --> 00:03:52.155
KIND OF THINGS.

00:03:52.156 --> 00:03:53.323
IT IS STILL THERE

00:03:53.324 --> 00:03:53.890
FIRST AMENDMENT RIGHT.

00:03:53.891 --> 00:03:57.894
&gt;&gt; Tucker: OF COURSE IT IS.

00:03:57.895 --> 00:03:59.095
PEOPLE COMPLAIN, BUT WHAT WOULD

00:03:59.096 --> 00:04:00.697
YOUR COLLEAGUES SAY IF YOU SAID

00:04:00.698 --> 00:04:00.997
THAT?

00:04:00.998 --> 00:04:02.132
&gt;&gt; I'M SURE THEY WOULD BE

00:04:02.133 --> 00:04:05.101
DISGUSTED AND UPSET WITH ME,

00:04:05.102 --> 00:04:07.671
SOMEWHAT.

00:04:07.672 --> 00:04:10.140
THEY DON'T HAVE TO BE OPEN --

00:04:10.141 --> 00:04:11.675
&gt;&gt; Tucker: BUT THEY SHOULD BE.

00:04:11.676 --> 00:04:13.309
THEY ARE NOT SUPPOSED TO BE

00:04:13.310 --> 00:04:15.111
SMALL MINDED, THEIRS WAS TO BE

00:04:15.112 --> 00:04:15.545
BROAD-MINDED.

00:04:15.546 --> 00:04:17.280
&gt;&gt; THESE ARE PEOPLE WHO ARE

00:04:17.281 --> 00:04:18.515
PROBABLY STUDIED THE ISSUE --

00:04:18.516 --> 00:04:20.450
&gt;&gt; Tucker: NO THEY HAVEN'T!

00:04:20.451 --> 00:04:22.285
&gt;&gt; PEOPLE STUDY FOR A LIVING.

00:04:22.286 --> 00:04:24.321
&gt;&gt; Tucker: THAT IS THE IRONY

